card.statement:
The affine Artin group $\A(R)$ is generated by the finite Artin group $\A(\Rring)$ and the lattice $\Q_Y$ such that the following relations are satisfied for all $1\leq i\leq n$ and $\mu\in M$

\begin{subequations}
\begin{alignat}{2}
& T_iY_\mu=Y_\mu T_i   \text{ if } (\mu, A_i^\vee)=0, \\
& T_iY_\mu T_i=Y_{s_i(\mu)} \text{ if } (\mu,A_i^\vee)=1.
\end{alignat}
\end{subequations}
